<h2>External Content Caches Cleared</h2>

<div class="messages messages--status">
  <h3>Cache clearing successfully initiated!</h3>
  <p>The caches for external content have been cleared. The changes will be visible after Varnish cache is invalidated (usually during the next cron run).</p>
</div>

<h3>Paragraph Types Cleared</h3>
<p>The following paragraph types with external content have been processed:</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Paragraph Type</th>
      <th>Number of Instances</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
  {% if paragraph_types %}
    {% for type_id, info in paragraph_types %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ info.name }}</td>
        <td>{{ info.count }}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
    <tr>
      <td colspan="2">No external content paragraphs found.</td>
    </tr>
  {% endif %}
  </tbody>
</table>

{% if using_batch %}
<div class="messages messages--warning">
  <h3>Batch Processing Active</h3>
  <p>Due to the large number of paragraphs, batch processing has been activated. Cache clearing is running in the background and will complete shortly.</p>
</div>
{% else %}
<h3>Cache Tags Invalidated</h3>
<p>The following cache tags have been invalidated:</p>

<div class="cache-tags-container" style="max-height: 300px; overflow-y: auto; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
  {% if cids and cids|length > 0 %}
    <ul>
      {% for cid in cids %}
        {% for cache in cid %}
          <li>{{ cache }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  {% else %}
    <p>No cache tags were invalidated. This might happen if there are no external content paragraphs on the site.</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% endif %}

<p><a href="{{ path('system.admin_config') }}" class="button">Return to Configuration</a></p>
